package in that image with its licence, the source package it was built from,
and where that source package is published: Fedora's builds in Fedora's build
system, Koji, at the address given, and the others by the maker named there.
Everything not installed from a package is built from
https://github.com/iarsslen/amethystora at the commit the image names as
BUILD_ID in /usr/lib/os-release; its build_files pin each upstream release
they fetch.

